cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite it using this metadata and record the
  release or commit used. Work using the databases should also cite the
  NIST SRD 46 dataset listed under references and the original scientific
  publications relevant to the reported constants.
type: software
title: SRD-46 Data and Results
authors:
  - family-names: Sun
    given-names: Yunkai
    affiliation: Argonne National Laboratory, Lemont, IL, USA
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Core SQLite databases, Pourbaix species inventories, final scientific
  results, and a local read-only browser for NIST SRD 46. Source identifiers,
  references, review flags, and model estimates remain available in the
  retained database snapshot.
references:
  - type: data
    title: >-
      NIST SRD 46. Critically Selected Stability Constants of Metal Complexes:
      Version 8.0 for Windows
    authors:
      - name: National Institute of Standards and Technology
    publisher:
      name: National Institute of Standards and Technology
    year: 2004
    version: "8.0"
    doi: 10.18434/M32154
    url: https://www.nist.gov/srd/nist46
    notes: >-
      The official archive provides the source SQL extraction and its
      product-specific data terms. Source-data provenance and the preserved
      NIST README are documented in NOTICE.
